**Reusable libs/utils (not inside the package):**

- **Query building** — **`utils/query-builder`** (`@zavcode/query-builder`). Reusable across all packages for building Payload CMS queries. Contains: query params schema (Zod), query-builder helpers, and api-fetch utilities. Source of truth to extract from dev-playground: `apps/dev-playground/src/schemas/query-builder`, `apps/dev-playground/src/utils/query-builder`, `apps/dev-playground/src/utils/api-fetch`. Every package depends on this package instead of duplicating query logic.
- **Theme loading** — **`utils/`** (e.g. `utils/theme-loader` or `utils/theme-registry`). Reusable theme registry, active-theme resolution, and theme provider. Same behaviour as current dev-playground `src/theme/` (registry, register-themes, active-theme, theme-provider). The package does **not** ship its own `theme/` folder; it depends on this util. Apps and runtime use it to load the active theme from env and register themes from `ui/themes`.

