## Package Metadata Shape

Package metadata lives in `package.json` under the `zavcode` field. See `docs/development/packages.md` for the full convention.

```json
{
  "name": "@zavcode/website-starter",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Content website with pages, layout builder, forms, SEO, and i18n",
  "dependencies": { "@payloadcms/plugin-seo": "catalog:", "@payloadcms/plugin-form-builder": "catalog:" },
  "zavcode": {
    "displayName": "Website Starter",
    "plugins": ["@payloadcms/plugin-seo", "@payloadcms/plugin-form-builder"],
    "themes": {
      "allowed": ["ui-template"],
      "default": "ui-template"
    }
  }
}
```

