## Dev Workflow

```bash
# 1. Choose active package (in .env or .env.local)
ZAVCODE_PACKAGE=website-starter

# 2. Run runtime with that package
pnpm dev:runtime
# → nx dev runtime; runtime loads package from ZAVCODE_PACKAGE

# 3. Work on content model
#    Edit: packages/website-starter/src/payload/collections/Pages.ts

# 4. Generate types for the package
cd packages/website-starter && pnpm generate:types

# 5. Write/update schemas with full type safety
#    Edit: packages/website-starter/src/schemas/pages/index.ts

# 6. (Optional) Test in dev-playground instead of runtime
ZAVCODE_PACKAGE=website-starter pnpm dev:playground

# 7. Assemble ZIP (build script)
pnpm build:package website-starter
# → merges runtime + package + plugins + theme → ZIP
```

